# Clan Quarra: "Lord Irarak" (VA_VampCult). Volrina Quarra in Druscashti tolerates the new Quarra vampire and names
# a rogue ("use to me": 10, "I will kill him." 1: 20). In the Ginith Ancestral Tomb Irarak welcomes the player to
# the "Brood of Lord Irarak" (which is where the player learns the name Volrina's text never says), then dies
# (irarakScript logs 110 once the quest stands at 20), and Volrina keeps her word ("Brood of Lord Irarak": 120).
# The player comes down through the upper level's door, as a player does, before walking up to Volrina: her
# authored Fight is 90 and her script lowers it to 30 on its second run, so a player set down beside her as she
# loads is attacked (OpenMW isAggressive: Fight + ~20 up close >= 100).
# The kill stands in for the fight; `defend` takes his followers; `approach` stands in for the travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from va_quarra_cult_start --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case va_quarra_cult_start
run
player->PositionCell 448 900 -1504 0 "Druscashti, Upper Level"
until 300 GetPCCell "Druscashti, Upper Level" == 1
wait 60
activate 056757B0
until 300 GetPCCell "Druscashti, Lower Level" == 1
wait 120
approach 05D57D27
talk volrina quarra
ask use to me
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampCult == 10
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampCult == 20
bye
end

case va_quarra_cult_irarak
approach 05234277
wait 60
bye if open
talk Irarak
bye
defend
console 05234277.kill
until 600 GetJournalIndex VA_VampCult == 110
approach 05D57D27
talk volrina quarra
ask Brood of Lord Irarak
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampCult == 120
bye
end
